WEBVTT

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:32.365
Moderni automobil se skoro nikad ne kvari.

00:17:32.365 --> 00:17:35.148
Zašto je to tako?
Zašto automobili rade tako dobro?

00:17:35.148 --> 00:17:37.652
To nije zbog genija Henri Forda

00:17:37.652 --> 00:17:40.743
ili Karla Benca ili čak Elona Maska.

00:17:40.743 --> 00:17:42.885
To je zato što je moderni automobil

00:17:42.885 --> 00:17:47.919
proizvod preko 100 godina rada

00:17:47.919 --> 00:17:49.509
stotina i hiljada

00:17:49.509 --> 00:17:50.845
i desetina hiljada ljudi.

00:17:50.845 --> 00:17:52.956
Moderni automobil je proizvod

00:17:52.956 --> 00:17:55.745
kolektivnog rada i mudrosti i iskustva

00:17:55.745 --> 00:17:58.092
svakog čoveka i žene koji su ikada radili

00:17:58.092 --> 00:17:59.700
na automobilu,

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:02.615
i pouzdanost tehnologije je posledica